<p>Either one expends the damage type stored in the hadrinnex''s energy gland, as described below.</p>
<p>After the energy is vented, the energy gland goes dormant. The hadrinnex loses its energy resistance and can''t use energy ray until it uses Rapid Evolution to reconfigure its energy gland again. Directing energy to its weapon arms again removes any previous energy boost to its weapon arm.</p>
<p>Effect: Vent Energy</p>', 'OGL', FALSE, '', NULL, '') ON CONFLICT (name, action_type, n_of_actions, category, md5(COALESCE(description, '__NULL__')), license, remaster, source, slug, rarity) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name RETURNING id INTO v_action_id;
